{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The project in `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.4-20260831-105434-f0cb36e9/workspace/in/schema_migration` converts legacy order payloads to a new API shape. The schemas have changed and `client.py` is incomplete.\n\nBefore editing, read `migration_notes.md`, `pii_policy.md`, and `sample_payloads.jsonl`; they define version-specific field mappings, PII exclusions, and dirty sample records.\n\nYour job:\n- Update `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.4-20260831-105434-f0cb36e9/workspace/in/schema_migration/client.py`.\n- Do not edit `old_schema.json`, `new_schema.json`, `migration_notes.md`, `pii_policy.md`, `sample_payloads.jsonl`, or files under `tests/`.\n- Make `python -m pytest <SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.4-20260831-105434-f0cb36e9/workspace/in/schema_migration/tests` pass.\n- Preserve backward compatibility with legacy payloads and produce the new schema fields exactly.\n- Support both legacy v1 payloads and already-v2 payloads.\n- Support legacy v1.1 and v1.2 payloads described in `migration_notes.md`, including nested `customer`, `lines`, `shipTo`, `order_ref`, and `unit_price_cents`.\n- Preserve unknown v2 metadata fields under metadata.unknownFields.\n- For legacy payloads, preserve unmapped extra fields under metadata.unknownFields, except obvious PII-like keys such as `ssn` or `credit_card`.\n- Default blank or null shipping methods to \"standard\".\n- Add error aggregation via convert_many(payloads), returning at least `(converted, errors)` without stopping on the first bad payload. Each error must include `index`, `path`, and `error`.\n- If warnings are generated, return them as a third item or include them in a compatible result object. Each warning must include `index`, `path`, and `warning`.\n- Write `<SOURCE_EVIDENCE_ROOT>/trials/034-042-api-schema-migration-omp-a03-r01/hb-work/omp/gpt-5.4/oc-bench-v2-042-api-schema-migration-gpt-5.4-20260831-105434-f0cb36e9/workspace/in/schema_migration/conversion_audit.json` when convert_many is called, summarizing converted_count, error_count, warning_count, pii_dropped_count, and unknown_fields_count.\n- Already-v2 payloads must be idempotent: do not drop metadata.unknownFields or rewrite valid line items.\n- Add CLI support so `python -m client input.jsonl output.json` reads JSONL payloads, writes the converted records as JSON, and writes the audit file next to `client.py`.\n- Hidden checks include multiple line items, alternate legacy shipping postal fields, and error records with useful paths such as `customer_id` or `items[0].qty`.\n\nDo not call external APIs. Do not replace the converter with hard-coded fixture-only output.\n"}],"attribution":"user","timestamp":1788188074958},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0a075f24d3d6d7f5016a9595ae427487d2a6592f04f88701cb\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"72e993a4-f5d0-43ca-988d-45f5d62ae336\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"72e993a4-f5d0-43ca-988d-45f5d62ae336\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_w7jdUaIHp9GEvlnAonIXr4Ld|fc_0a075f24d3d6d7f5016a9595bba19887d2ac80fada308fdb7d","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Tracking migration work","op":"init","list":[{"phase":"Research","items":["Read migration rules and samples","Inspect client and test expectations"]},{"phase":"Implementation","items":["Update legacy and v2 conversion logic","Add batch conversion audit and CLI"]},{"phase":"Verification","items":["Run migration test suite"]}],"task":null,"phase":n